<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Del Webb downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Del Webb downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers Inc said it downgraded Del Webb Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said it lowered its 1997 earnings estimate to $2.20 a share from $2.30.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- Del Webb dropped 3/8 to 17.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
